1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Murojaatdan mediator tekshiruvigacha

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:05,329
Muammo, talab va hujjatlar kiritiladi

3
00:00:05,329 --> 00:00:07,446
Yangi muammo boshlash

4
00:00:07,446 --> 00:00:08,634
Shartnoma nizosini tanlaydi

5
00:00:08,634 --> 00:00:16,545
Talab va vaziyatni yozadi

6
00:00:16,545 --> 00:00:22,707
Ikkinchi tarafga taklif yaratadi

7
00:00:22,707 --> 00:00:26,659
Tilxat va chekni yuklaydi

8
00:00:26,659 --> 00:00:28,290
Murojaatni tekshirib yuboradi

9
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:31,000
Taklif havolasi tayyor

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
AI ishloviga rozilik beradi

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:35,433
Taklifni ochib o‘z bayonini yozadi

12
00:00:35,433 --> 00:00:38,686
Taklif havolasini ochadi

13
00:00:38,686 --> 00:00:41,787
Murojaat bilan tanishadi

14
00:00:41,787 --> 00:00:48,791
O‘z bayonini kiritadi

15
00:00:48,791 --> 00:00:58,000
5 millionlik chekni yuklaydi

16
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
AI ikkala bayonni tahlil qiladi

17
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Umumiy faktlar va tafovutlar ko‘rinadi

18
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,000
To‘rtta kelishuv taklifi tayyorlanadi

19
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,500
Birinchi taklifga o‘zgartirish so‘raladi

20
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:16,000
Ikkinchi taraf ham javob beradi

21
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,500
Birinchi taraf jadvalni ma’qullaydi

22
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:23,000
Ikkinchi taraf ham ma’qullaydi

23
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Mediatorga yuborishga rozilik beradi

24
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Ikkala rozilik bilan so‘rov ochiladi

25
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Shahridagi mediator so‘rovni qabul qiladi

26
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,500
Mediator ikkala bayonni tekshiradi

27
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:39,500
Hujjat matni va summalarni solishtiradi

28
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:42,000
AI taklifini dalillar bilan solishtiradi

29
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Kelishilgan rejani tasdiqlaydi

30
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Tasdiqlangan reja ikkala tarafga ko‘rinadi

31
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Har ikki taraf uchun tushunarli jarayon
